== History ==
From a very young age he saw his father train martial arts so he began to be interested in martial arts specifically muay thai.

One day his father told him that he was going somewhere and that he would soon return, days passed and as he did not return Kla gave his father for dead but instead of letting himself fall into sadness he began to train hard to become a martial arts fighter.

And finally the day came, I was in the final of the world tournament, there was a moment of silence and then the bell rang, the fight started and each time it became more and more tense but in the end Kla won.

Voltio to see the public and noticed a strange figure, it was his father, Kla was glad that his father would be happy that his son became the world champion but seeing that he walked away from the crowd was shocked.

Kla was angry to learn that he was still alive, he wondered that because he abandoned him and what he was doing all those years, Kla fell into a deep depression.

